    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work! Wan Wan Human is an [ADV Novel Game of Human Gachi-Inukenka] that educates sinners and turns them into adorable dogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a correctional officer in a city of chaos where humans, demons, and angels are all mixed together and get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your unique colleagues and sinners are waiting to meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As of 2024, only Japanese is supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/1f4245ed23da901f79184691e66e7ba9.webp?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=55 /></span>The earth has been transformed into a new world populated by angels and demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the player, will work for a big white company called \u201cAngel Enterprises\u201d where angels gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work! Educate the sinners and build a world where peace can last!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work! Like a dog! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/a23fee426af8a86f4acaa28fa4c887e6.webp?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/f6f5deec8d15c72c9e9fbbd121577636.poster.avif?t=1741878023\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/f6f5deec8d15c72c9e9fbbd121577636.webm?t=1741878023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/f6f5deec8d15c72c9e9fbbd121577636.mp4?t=1741878023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Your work</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to educate the sinners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the conversation over the course of four turns and decide if education is really necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/aea58d20a0313d6582029d603daaf333.poster.avif?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/aea58d20a0313d6582029d603daaf333.webm?t=1741878023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/aea58d20a0313d6582029d603daaf333.mp4?t=1741878023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fun labor other than education</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your duty to help other colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also responsible for helping other co-workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/94de233a083e9fa5057edf4111046271.webp?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=55 /></span>The funny characters in this game are sure to make your work worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will surely make your work worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/7eeef8b73652d0c040094312efe41dad.avif?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=310 /></span><strong>You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correctional Officer at Angel Enterprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anata, the player, can select male/female and enter a name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/1e0b1b25dabd4be3550d9f7fcfc45817.avif?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=310 /></span><strong>Bercy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely colleague you can count on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be numb to the lines that push sinners away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/a9cbf93c88065ed8f39db0aa1ea7c60e.avif?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=310 /></span><strong>Sinners of Distinctive Character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may be electrocuted or educated as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/7c8c50507013defe580af125b259fe62.avif?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=310 /></span><strong>Colleagues with a lot of personality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No current flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973410/extras/3d2f72a32337753569d98b8a49a145d4.webp?t=1741878023\" width=616 height=55 /></span>Elements included in this game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodshed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homosexuality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Depiction of suicide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the actual situation, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be sure to include the URL of the store page.</p>",
